<title>MEXICO: Texas to Mexico livestock export weekly - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas to Mexico livestock export weekly - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA reported Tuesday updated figures of livestock exports to Mexico from the state of Texas to May 5.</p>
<p>Species		   Wk-To-Date   Yr-Date   Last Year</p>
<p>1) Beef Cattle</p>
<p>a.  Slaughter		  0	    41,533     20,528</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Males	   0	     1,009	  545</p>
<p>c.  Breeding Females	 0	     2,133	  571</p>
<p>Total			    0	    44,675     21,644</p>
<p>2) Hogs</p>
<p>a.  Slaughter		  0		 410     31,630</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Males	   0		 252	   46</p>
<p>c.  Breeding Females	 0	     3,373	  311</p>
<p>3) Dairy Cattle</p>
<p>a.  Breeding Males	   0		  98	   18</p>
<p>b.  Breeding Females	 0	    10,271	4,038</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom +525 7289530))</p>
